          "text": "Bandits, twice this month. They do not care who is driving.",
          "next": "greet"
        },
        {
          "id": "accept",
          "text": "Good. Stay close and keep your eyes on the treeline."
        },
        {
          "id": "decline",
          "text": "Then I will take my chances alone."
        }
